  <p id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="witness_appended_qing_siku_collation"><rs id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:w0000" type="unresolved">王融傳</rs>居中自見○<rs id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:w0008" type="unresolved">汲古閣本</rs>見下注<rs id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:w0015" type="unresolved">宋本</rs>作是事符則感○<rs id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:w0024" type="unresolved">汲古閣本</rs>感下注<rs id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:w0031" type="unresolved">宋本</rs>作咸按感字為是<rs id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:w0040" type="unresolved">宋本</rs>誤也不容都無主此○主<rs id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:w0052" type="unresolved">南監本</rs>作彼<rs id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:w0057" type="unresolved">謝朓傳</rs><persName id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:m0060" ref="q2u_kqh_bt5">沈昭畧</persName>謂<persName id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:m0064" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABDCA">朓</persName>曰卿人地之美無忝此職但恨今日刑于寡妻○<title id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:w0084" ref="w-nanshi">南史</title>作尚書郎<persName id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:m0090" ref="fwc_fzf_pjh">范縝</persName>嘲<persName id="c-nanqishu-047-qing-collation:p001:m0093" ref="aa6_83c_juy_ABDCA">朓</persName>之語</p>
</text>
